      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Event Relevancy Screening (stand-in)\nGets rows from the parent, does one piece of \"work\" per row and adds `relevant` or `irrelevant` to that row's `status`. Returns the rows with their new status, which is what the next IF in the parent looks at.",
